cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ClambHook
message: >-
  If you reference ClambHook in academic, technical, or comparative work,
  please cite it using this metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Pengfan
    family-names: Chang
    email: support@swiphtgroup.com
repository-code: https://github.com/JohnThre/clambhook
url: https://clambercloud.com/clambhook/
abstract: >-
  ClambHook is a cross-platform privacy and traffic-routing application for
  macOS, GNU/Linux, and Android. It combines a VPN and proxy client (SOCKS5,
  HTTP(S) proxy, and device-wide TUN routing over WireGuard, OpenVPN,
  Shadowsocks, VMESS, ShadowTLS, and Tor) with an opt-in local HTTP(S) capture
  and debugging workbench, backed by a C17 runtime.
keywords:
  - vpn
  - proxy
  - socks5
  - wireguard
  - openvpn
  - shadowsocks
  - http-debugging
  - network-inspection
  - privacy
  - macos
  - linux
  - android
license: GPL-3.0-only
